storical_business_count":0},{"category":"Flowers & Gifts","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Cosmetics & Beauty Supply","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Specialty Food","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Spiritual Shop","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Gift Shops","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Shopping","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Home & Garden","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Herbs & Spices","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Nurseries & Gardening","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YazC5kqwscVNn2kE7s6A4g","review_id":"kgJb5s1HKI4Zcn_lYDRZgQ","date":"2014-01-30T17:00:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9197472929954529,"text_excerpt":"First off, this is the botanica of all botanicas. F&F Botanica is an occultist's dream warehouse. This is the ultimate supply of votive candles, folks. Every imaginable prayer candle that exists will be found at F&F Botanica-- but most significant of all, this is the cheapest place to find candles. Not only are they the cheapest candles, but they are made from 100% wax and are top quality. It's really a shame that touristy shops like Reverand Zombie's sells their candles for $7 and above, when at F&F, one can find the same candle, but in better quality for $2.89. In fact, why not take the $7 that you spend at a touristy shop in the Vieux Carre, and come visit F&F where you can buy a \"dres..."},{"business_id":"YazC5kqwscVNn2kE7s6A4g","review_id":"dOpPlwWU5D7RL14HmimCQg","date":"2014-06-19T17:30:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9168468713760376,"text_excerpt":"I really like this place. It is a bit overwhelming when you walk in because there is soooo much here! They have candles for every reason and season- ask if you don't see what you want or don't know what you need. They also carry oils, herbs, incense, and a lot of spiritual/religious products."},{"business_id":"YazC5kqwscVNn2kE7s6A4g","review_id":"F2EvNMrnrqvb1e_qxgglgg","date":"2017-03-30T19:12:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9131808280944824,"text_excerpt":"Wow. The variety of candles and oils in this store is unbelievable and the couple that owns the shop are just as great! I love coming here. The energy is so positive and I feel very welcomed. Honestly, I've never bought any spirituality things aside from a piece of turquoise and a self-help book once but I thought it would be nice to cleanse my house with a prayer candle. My friend, Tom, recommended I try F&F. In addition to the white candle I bought, which they gave me instructions on how to use and discard, I also purchased some really nice oils. You can tell this place is genuine and they aren't in it for the money. Very professional, helpful, and friendly! I will be back soon!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
